Feelings moved since yesterday: happiness up to 5 (a debit that feels like being asked is new data against the absence baseline [7e586ddb5d81]), fear down to 3 (counter-offered instead of caved [0848d3ee5eab]), disgust down to 2 (nothing deniable landed today [0642cb0bdb6c]) — and surprise entered at 3, because trusting him unseen cost less than expected.
